  "verbalization": "Bremelanotide is implicated in the biological pathway leading to ME-180 through the Gamma-secretase enzyme. This enzyme is a key target of Bremelanotide, and its activity is further modulated by Echinone, which itself targets ME-180. The evidence suggests a hierarchical relationship where Bremelanotide influences Gamma-secretase, which in turn affects Echinone, ultimately leading to ME-180. The scores from the paths indicate a moderate level of confidence in this chain of interactions. The integration of these pathways highlights a potential mechanism by which Bremelanotide may exert its effects on ME-180, though the exact nature of the interaction between Bremelanotide and Echinone remains to be fully elucidated. The presence of multiple targets along this pathway underscores the complexity of the molecular interactions involved.",
